    <string name="welcome_to_pocket_paint">Karibu kwenye Pocket Paint</string>
    <string name="intro_welcome_text">Ukiwa na Pocket Paint, ubunifu wako hauna kikomo. Ikiwa wewe ni mgeni, anza utangulizi, au uruke ikiwa tayari unaifahamu Pocket Paint.</string>
